  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EH9RXWf.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/Mini-Me-Totem\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-0C0D0F?logo=github&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fNotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--Fi-0C0D0F?logo=kofi&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://twitch.tv/NotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitch-0C0D0F?logo=twitch&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-0C0D0F?logo=discord&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p><strong>🧸 Mini-Me Totem</strong> 是一款輕量級資源包，會將「不滅图腾」替換為您 Minecraft 皮膚的 Q版小圖示。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用您自己的皮膚作為图腾模型  </li>\n<li>設定簡單—只需替換一個檔案  </li>\n<li>非常適合內容創作者或個人化需求  </li>\n<li>可與其他資源包相容，且對效能友善</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>安裝說明</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>下載您的 Minecraft 皮膚（例如來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnamemc.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NameMC</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftskins.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MinecraftSkins</a>）。</li>\n<li>替換以下路徑中的檔案：<ul>\n<li><code>assets/minecraft/textures/item/totem_of_undying.png</code>（適用於 1.13 及以上版本）</li>\n<li>或 <code>assets/minecraft/textures/item/totem.png</code>（適用於 1.13 以下版本）</li></ul></li>\n<li>儲存並載入至 Minecraft。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>預覽</h2>\n<p>\n  <strong>預設皮膚</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cGJf4uI.png\" width=\"500\">\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>自訂皮膚</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DqLfoIE.png\" width=\"500\">\n</p>\n<h2>技術支援</h2>\n<p>如需協助或回報問題，請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/mini-me-totem/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上開啟 Issue，或加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>",
